"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某物質的莫耳燃燒焓為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-500\\ \\mathrm{kJ/mol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">kJ/mol</span></span></span></span></span></span>。燃燒 0.020 mol 該物質，若產生的熱量全部被 200 g 水吸收，水的初溫為 25°C，求末溫。假設水的比熱容為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.18</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.18\\ \\mathrm{J/(g\\cdot{}^\\circ C)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.18</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">J/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>，且沒有相變。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">題目三：中和熱與實驗判讀</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">將 50.0 mL、1.0 M 的 HCl(aq) 與 50.0 mL、1.0 M 的 NaOH(aq) 混合，初溫皆為 25.0°C，最高溫度達 31.5°C。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">假設混合溶液密度為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.00\\ \\mathrm{g/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>、比熱容為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.18</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.18\\ \\mathrm{J/(g\\cdot{}^\\circ C)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.18</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">J/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>，且忽略量熱器吸熱。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">求：</p>\n<ol class=\"List-bYalj1\" data-d-component=\"list\" data-d-marker=\"number\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\" style=\"--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 