ht: 0.7224em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component=\"table-row\"><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">反應焓變</p></td><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">生成物焓 − 反應物焓</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component=\"table-row\"><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">赫斯定律</p></td><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">總焓變等於各步驟焓變之和</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component=\"table-row\"><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">生成熱計算</p></td><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">生成物總生成焓 − 反應物總生成焓</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component=\"table-row\"><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">量熱法</p></td><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=mc\\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component=\"table-row\"><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">能量守恆</p></td><td data-d-component=\"table-cell\" data-d-valign=\"start\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">系統與環境交換的總熱量相加為零（適當假設下）</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Edges-nCUHEi\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 933px; height: 299px;\"></div></div>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">學習本章最重要的不是背誦所有反應熱數值，而是掌握三個關聯：<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">反應前後的能量差、反應式與焓變的對應關係，以及實驗測得的熱量如何轉換為莫耳反應焓。</strong></span></p>","messageId":"3dcaee9f-be82-4277-ac9d-9602af2db2de","numbered":["1","2","3","4"],"progress":[]}]}